{"4138920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aliya: Timelink2 Dawn", "steam_appid": 4138920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Find Out Us</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HeyBox &amp; BiliBili &amp; Afadian &amp; Rednote &amp; Douyin &amp; TapTap: 瞳电游工作室</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Contact Us</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email: publish@tdgame.studio</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Aliya: Timelink 2 – Dawn, the story breathes in real time, in perfect sync with your own. Inside the screen and out, the clock marches forward. Even when you close the game, the world keeps living. Time doesn’t pause for anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Aliya has returned to the Tayris Corporation, stepping back into a place heavy with memory and unresolved echoes. Through a link that stretches across a thousand years, you and your closest companions will weave a new chapter together—one message, one choice, one fragile moment at a time. Every decision leaves its mark. What ending will your path carve out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of future—or ruin—will you guide Aliya toward? And when the hourglass turns and time circles back, will you find the strength to walk a different road?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong><i><u>“We can’t solve this crisis that spans a thousand years on our own. Without you here, we can’t do anything.”</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\">—— Aliya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138920/extras/e838a6003e48a2881eae488c004835ef.avif?t=1784097339\" width=1170 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct